description:
a) Ludian County Afforestation Project in Yunnan Province (hereafter referred to as “the project”) is located in Ludian  County, Zhaotong City, Yunnan Province,  China. The project is to establish forest on the non-forest land to generate GHG emission removals and contribute to  local sustainable development. The project start date is 02/01/2016 which is the date that planting started. The project is 7,355.25 ha of forest was established by direct planted on non-forest lands in Ludian County, Zhaotong City, Yunnan Province, China.
b) The project activity aims to:
- Sequester carbon dioxide and mitigating climate change;
- Enhance biodiversity conservation by increasing the forest cover, plant species and population of animals;
- Improve the quality and quantity of the plants;
- Generate income and job opportunities for local communities
c) The location of the forest land of the afforestation project belongs to the 10 towns and 2 townships,  which including Wenpin Town, Xiaozhai Town, Longtoushan Town, Huodehong Town, Jiangdi Town, Lehong Town, Suoshan Town,  Shuimo Town, Xinjie Town, Longshu Town and 2 ethnic townships,  which are Ziyuan and Taoyuan. All lands involved in project area (7,355.25ha) are collectively owned by villages and all land tenure belongs to local villages or villagers group. Land owners (all involved village collectives) agreed and  authorized their land to PP for this proposed afforestation project. After afforestation,  the forest land is managed and supervised by the Ludian State-owned Forest Farm as project proponent. Sichuan Sentan  Industrial Co., Ltd is project consultant ,  who is authorized to help project proponent develop the carbon sink project. And the income from the carbon sink project  belongs to the project proponent and the villagers. There is no natural renewal and reforestation and all sites were  non-forest lands and non-forest lands at least 10 years prior to the implementation of the project.
